13. Reconstruction cue

```text
Rebuild DORM by preserving five separations:

  generated experience / observing model
  awareness / revisability
  capability / calibration
  dream disconnection / wakeful external competition
  meaningful internal state / externally verified causal claim

Then connect consequence to verification through a Governor that cannot be
waived by intelligence, confidence, urgency, mythology, or internal authority.
```

14. Compact Seal

```text
Two layers may remain online:
  one inhabits the world-model;
  one observes the model.

Lucidity = awareness × revisability.
Capability ≠ calibration.
Dream lucidity may expand play inside the dream.
Wakeful lucidity must increase caution before consequential action.

When the map may be flooded, launch the Dove:
  scout externally → return evidence → measure delta → revise → act boundedly.
```

